    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>The Solo-Developer Project: &quot;ManHunter&quot;:</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ManHunter</strong> is intentionally tailored to <strong>increase the players intelligence</strong>, through activities like chess puzzles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While also providing an <strong>exhilarating Video-Game experience</strong> like no other...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key that sets men apart from one another, is <strong>Knowledge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knowledge is power.</strong> And <strong>ManHunter</strong> is an archive of useful human knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocking access to more information, the further you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constantly evolving.</strong> Constantly adding new Information to it's archive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unstoppable. Just like you could be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Change your life today.</strong> Download <strong>ManHunter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465850/extras/a0fd623acd54359fd863d109ed042c75.avif?t=1753745537\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer your opponents</strong>. Steal their information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play up to 3v3 Fast-Paced, Turn-Based Combat. Unlocking new companions, Abilities, and Items, over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook recipes using any random 2-4 Ingredients.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and customize your Syndicates Base.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465850/extras/553388c2e4d582e90096b8470f7cf457.avif?t=1753745537\" width=432 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Prologue</strong> Story Arc &amp; <strong>The Plains</strong> Story Arc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>500</strong> Unique Cinematic Comic Panels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465850/extras/b7ca048b4b5be0eb2010a2c5562a9524.poster.avif?t=1753745537\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465850/extras/b7ca048b4b5be0eb2010a2c5562a9524.webm?t=1753745537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465850/extras/b7ca048b4b5be0eb2010a2c5562a9524.mp4?t=1753745537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is <strong>&quot;ManHunter&quot;</strong> the greatest game ever made?? <strong>FUCK NO!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it's pretty good! Give it a shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo-Developer: (</strong>Check out my instagram, Bro. <i>B)</i>\u00a0 :\u00a0 @<strong>oscarshypr__)</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>The Solo-Developer Project: &quot;ManHunter&quot;:</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ManHunter</strong> is intentionally tailored to <strong>increase the players intelligence</strong>, through activities like chess puzzles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While also providing an <strong>exhilarating Video-Game experience</strong> like no other...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key that sets men apart from one another, is <strong>Knowledge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knowledge is power.</strong> And <strong>ManHunter</strong> is an archive of useful human knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocking access to more information, the further you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constantly evolving.</strong> Constantly adding new Information to it's archive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unstoppable. Just like you could be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Change your life today.</strong> Download <strong>ManHunter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465850/extras/a0fd623acd54359fd863d109ed042c75.avif?t=1753745537\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer your opponents</strong>. Steal their information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play up to 3v3 Fast-Paced, Turn-Based Combat. Unlocking new companions, Abilities, and Items, over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook recipes using any random 2-4 Ingredients.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and customize your Syndicates Base.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><spa